<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia YTL 6-mth net up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia YTL 6-mth net up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 162.77   vs	 146.40</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 27.67   vs	  27.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		   900.04   vs	 778.63</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   210.73   vs	 180.68</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  7.40   vs  less   7.14</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   13.11   vs	   0.29</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is YTL Corp Bhd. It is involved in power generation and infrastructure construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
